[
  {
    "text": "日常生活的织锦",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.10071910091700689,
      "left": 0.3627450829248366,
      "width": 0.27450980620914983,
      "height": 0.030303029040404043
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "每个星期六早上6点30分,第一批顾客还没到,河湾市场的摊主们就已经开始卸货了。这",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.16446939418877496,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7607842886437901,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "个市场自1948年起就开在杨树街的四个街区上,据老街坊说,七十多年来从未停过一个",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.1871966659690781,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.749039135456701,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "星期。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2099239377493811,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.058823529901960686,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "如今这里大约有140个摊位,而十年前只有85个。根据市政府2023年的调查,市场在普",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2449618150773482,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7490391254076819,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "通周末能吸引约12000名顾客,每年为本地经济带来约420万元的收入(周边的咖啡馆和",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.2676890868576512,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7568822162573567,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "小店还不算在内)",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29041635863795434,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.15686274640522851,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.29041635863795434,
      "left": 0.2696078358251633,
      "width": 0.014705878799019668,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "“大家都以为我们卖的是蔬菜,",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.32640120562343405,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.265431368352124,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "”在这里摆了27年菜摊的王秀兰说,“其实我们卖的是一个",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.32640120562343405,
      "left": 0.3781764553210784,
      "width": 0.4896274266576794,
      "height": 0.01515151452020195
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "让人愿意进城的理由。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.34912847740373704,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.19607843300653563,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "”她说,卖得最好",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.34912847740373704,
      "left": 0.3088235214460782,
      "width": 0.14288231880147165,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的还是两块钱一袋的什锦青菜。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.34912847740373704,
      "left": 0.45170584024755,
      "width": 0.2745098062091496,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "数据也印证了她",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.38416635473170424,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.1372549031045749,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "出效应”。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4296208982923102,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.08896077545996754,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "的说法。赶集日的人流量比其他星期六高出38%,四分之三的顾客表",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.38416635473170424,
      "left": 0.2549019570261436,
      "width": 0.5915685742483666,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "示,他们还顺便去了附近的其他店铺。省立大学的经济学家李明教授把这种现象称",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4068936265120072,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7058823588235279,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "为“溢",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4068936265120072,
      "left": 0.8235294127450965,
      "width": 0.049745098453758047,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "当然,问题也不少。今年1月,摊位费从每天35元涨到了50元,几位老摊主说这笔开销很",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4646587756202774,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7608038015106242,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "难承受。停车依然是最常见的抱怨:最近的公共停车场只有220个车位,通常上午9点15",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.4873860474005805,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7529606594109514,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "分之前就停满了。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5101133191808834,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.15686274640522851,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "市议会正在考虑一项提案,计划在5月1日至10月31日期间再封闭两个街区,禁止车辆通",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5460981661663633,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7451567395400361,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "行。支持者认为这样可以多容纳40个摊位;反对者则担心送货不便,也担心老年居民出",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5688254379466663,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7490195222222243,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "行困难。不少年轻人习惯用手机App付款,摊主们也陆续贴出了二维码。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.5915527097269694,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.6240980065939544,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "眼下,一切照旧。到了中午,面包已经卖光,花桶空了一半,喷泉旁边有一支铜管乐队在",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6265905870549365,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7647058887254882,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "演奏(五位退休教师,自称“第二春”)",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6493178588352395,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.33478431651535884,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "。下午2点,卡车又重新装满了。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6493178588352395,
      "left": 0.4475293953598039,
      "width": 0.2813725409359473,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "关于封路计划的公开听证会定于3月14日星期四晚上7点在市政厅204室举行。书面意见可",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.6843557361632068,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.7636862102140535,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
  {
    "text": "在本月底之前寄送至秘书处。",
    "bounds": {
      "top": 0.7070830079435098,
      "left": 0.11764705392156861,
      "width": 0.25490196290849626,
      "height": 0.015151514520202022
    },
    "normalized_conf": 1,
    "engine": "pdftext"
  },
